<title>USA: Team Rental Group selling 7.5 million shares.</title>
<headline>Team Rental Group selling 7.5 million shares.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTONA BEACH, Fla. 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Team Rental Group Inc said it is selling 7.5 million shares in a public offering priced Wednesday at $21.625.</p>
<p>When the transaction closes on April 29, the company will receive proceeds of about $154.1 million after applicable underwriting fees are deducted.</p>
<p>Proceeds will be used to fund the closing of Team's acquisition of Budget Rent a Car Corp, which is also expected to close on April 29.</p>
